%string ck_str_storyText "Atroxian Realm\n\nThe Alphamatic\n\nAfter discovering that\nVitaCorp created the\nAtroxians, Keen returns\nto his backyard\nworkshop to analyze a\nhard drive he salvaged\nfrom Atroxus.\n\nTo decrypt the files,\nhe'll need to hack into\nVitaCorp's network.\nUnfortunately, all\nVitaCorp facilities\nhave vanished without a\ntrace.\n\nExcept for one: THE\nALPHAMATIC, a beefed-up\narmageddon machine now\norbiting Mars. VitaCorp\nplans to wipe out the\nsolar system and with\nit, Keen, who might\nreveal their secret.\n\nKeen stealthily sneaks\naboard the station,\nhoping to uncover\nVitaCorp's true plot\nand save the galaxy...\nagain..."

